# GTA San Andreas 1.0 US (HOODLUM-compatible exe, image base 0x400000)
#
# Format:  <address> [<size>] <name>      ('#' and '//' start comments)
#
# This is a small seed list of well-known functions, compiled from public
# reverse-engineering documentation. Names are function identifiers only.
# Entries without a size are matched as "nearest preceding symbol within MaxGap
# bytes" and shown with a '~' in the log, so treat them as hints.
#
# For full coverage regenerate this file from headers that document the game's functions:
#     python tools/gen_symbols.py path/to/headers -o data/gta_sa_1.0_us.symbols
# If an address below is wrong for your exe, fix it or delete the line.

